WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Selective PF₆⁻ adsorption in an ion-exchange resin bed.
Yellow-green wastewater colour does not imply decolourisation.

00:06.000 --> 00:13.000
Proposed multi-column system: adsorption and elution alternate in parallel.
Four columns are illustrative, not final engineering.

00:13.000 --> 00:18.000
Proposed thermal elution followed by heat exchange.
Regeneration conditions and resin reuse remain under development.

00:18.000 --> 00:23.000
Proposed ambient-temperature fluidised-bed crystallisation of KPF₆.
Product yield and purity require validation.

00:23.000 --> 00:28.000
An integrated modular recovery train: concept installation only.
Not an operating plant or a representation of Livium’s site.
